## Issues Identified:

### 1. **Product Save Issues - Form Validation Problems**

The main issue is in the form validation logic. Looking at the product approval component, there are several validation mismatches:

<augment_code_snippet path="frontend/src/app/features/admin/components/product-approval/product-approval.component.ts" mode="EXCERPT">
