### 2. **Photo Loading Issues**

The image URL resolution has multiple fallback paths that may not work correctly:

<augment_code_snippet path="frontend/src/app/features/admin/components/product-approval/product-approval.component.ts" mode="EXCERPT">
```typescript
resolveImageUrl(url?: string): string | undefined {
 if (!url) return undefined;
 if (url.startsWith('data:image')) return url;
 if (url.startsWith('/api/') || url.startsWith('/uploads/') || url.startsWith('/images/')) {
 return `${environment.apiUrl}${url}`;
 }
 const clean = url.replace(/^\/?(images\/?)/, '');
 return `${environment.apiUrl}/uploads/images/${clean}`;
}
```
</augment_code_snippet>

### 3. **ID Changes During Updates**

The backend service reloads the product after saving, which can cause ID inconsistencies:

<augment_code_snippet path="src/main/java/com/example/stage2025/service/impl/ProductServiceImpl.java" mode="EXCERPT">
